# Touchscreen registers the driver loses on every suspend, written by armada-trackpad-firmware.service at
# boot and after each resume (docs/design.md, "Touchscreen firmware"). One line each:
# driver, register (lowercase 0xnn), decimal value 0..255.
#
# FT5452 touch threshold: 5, from the firmware's 50, so light touches register sooner. No ghost touches
# with nothing on the panel. On resume the driver first writes back its own cached threshold, so for
# the ~0.4 s until this unit runs it is 50, and sysfs `threshold` keeps showing the driver's cache, not 5.
edt_ft5x06 0x80 5
# FT5452 move threshold (THDIFF): 1, from the firmware's 128. A swipe starts moving after the panel's
# own floor of 2-3 reports instead of waiting for a set distance; no added jitter with a finger at rest.
edt_ft5x06 0x85 1
